cators&#x2F;exchange-rates&#x2F;daily-indicative-exchange-rates" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Data source</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <p class="dataset-links"><a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;api.frankfurter.dev&#x2F;v2&#x2F;rates.csv?base&#x3D;lkr&amp;providers&#x3D;cbsl&amp;from&#x3D;2011-01-20&amp;group&#x3D;month" rel="nofollow">Download historical dataset</a>.</p> <h2 id="api">API example</h2> <p>Fetch the latest rates from Central Bank of Sri Lanka with the API.</p><pre><code class="language-json">curl https:&#x2F;&#x2F;api.frankfurter.dev&#x2F;v2&#x2F;providers&#x2F;cbsl&#x2F;rates</code></pre><p>For the full reference and more examples, see <a href="/">the docs</a>.</p> <script type="application/ld+json"> { "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Dataset", "name": "Central Bank of Sri Lanka (CBSL) exchange rates", "description": "Central Bank of Sri Lanka (CBSL): current and historical daily exchange rates for 56 currencies from 2011 to present. Free API, no key or account required.", "url": "https://frankfurter.dev/providers/cbsl/", "temporalCoverage": "2011-01-20/..", "isAccessibleForFree": true, "creator": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Central Bank of Sri Lanka" }, "provider": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Frankfurter", "url": "https://frankfurter.dev" }, "variableMeasured": { "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Exchange rate", "description": "Indicative rate" }, "distribution": [ { "@type": "DataDownload", "encodingFormat": "text/csv", "contentUrl": "https://api.frankfurter.dev/v2/rates.csv?base=lkr&providers=cbsl&from=2011-01-20&group=month" }, { "@type": "DataDownload", "encodingFormat": "application/json", "contentUrl": "https://api.frankfurter.dev/v2/rates?base=lkr&providers=cbsl&from=2011-01-20&group=month" } ], "license": "https://frankfurter.dev/license/" } </script> </main> <footer> <div class="footer-links"> <div class="footer-col"> <h4>API</h4> <a href="/">v2</a> <a href="/v1/">v1</a> <a href="https://api.frankfurter.dev/v2/openapi.